    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>fp32 query tiles for the BLAS exhaustive-search kernels.</para>
<para>A kernel calls <ref refid="structfaiss_1_1Fp32QueryTiles_1a1b093fde234e254d00bab97d4f41c414" kindref="member">prepare_norms()</ref> once, then tile(i0, i1, x_norms) for each query tile; the returned rows stay valid until the next tile() call. </para>
